# Rate Limiting Guidelines

## Mục tiêu

Tài liệu này định nghĩa các nguyên tắc và best practices cho việc implement Rate Limiting trong Cursor Enterprise Framework. Mục tiêu là đảm bảo API protection, fair usage, và prevent abuse.

Rate limiting control traffic flow to protect systems from overload và abuse.

## Nguyên tắc cơ bản

### 1. Rate Limiting Strategies

Common approaches.

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                  Rate Limiting Strategies                          │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                                  │
│  Fixed Window                                                   │
│  ┌─────┬─────┬─────┬─────┐                                      │
│  │ 100 │ 100 │ 100 │ 100 │  requests per hour                 │
│  └─────┴─────┴─────┴─────┘                                      │
│                                                                  │
│  Sliding Window                                                 │
│  ┌─────────────────────────────────┐                            │
│  │  Rolling count over time window  │                            │
│  └─────────────────────────────────┘                            │
│                                                                  │
│  Token Bucket                                                   │
│  ┌─────┐                                                       │
│  │Token│ ───▶ Request ───▶ Refill                              │
│  └─────┘                                                       │
│                                                                  │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### 2. Implementation

Rate limiter examples.

```typescript
// Token bucket algorithm
class TokenBucketRateLimiter {
    private tokens: number;
    private lastRefill: number;

    constructor(
        private capacity: number,
        private refillRate: number, // tokens per second
        private refillInterval: number = 1000
    ) {
        this.tokens = capacity;
        this.lastRefill = Date.now();
    }

    async consume(tokens: number = 1): Promise<boolean> {
        this.refill();

        if (this.tokens >= tokens) {
            this.tokens -= tokens;
            return true;
        }

        return false;
    }

    private refill(): void {
        const now = Date.now();
        const elapsed = now - this.lastRefill;
        const tokensToAdd = Math.floor((elapsed / this.refillInterval) * this.refillRate);

        this.tokens = Math.min(this.capacity, this.tokens + tokensToAdd);
        this.lastRefill = now;
    }

    getRemainingTokens(): number {
        this.refill();
        return this.tokens;
    }
}

// Usage with middleware
const limiter = new TokenBucketRateLimiter(
    capacity: 100,      // 100 requests
    refillRate: 10,    // 10 per second
    refillInterval: 1000
);

app.use('/api', async (req, res, next) => {
    const allowed = await limiter.consume();

    if (!allowed) {
        return res.status(429).json({
            error: {
                code: 'RATE_LIMIT_EXCEEDED',
                message: 'Too many requests',
                retryAfter: 1
            }
        });
    }

    res.setHeader('X-RateLimit-Remaining', limiter.getRemainingTokens());
    next();
});
```

### 3. Distributed Rate Limiting

Scale across instances.

```typescript
// Redis-based distributed rate limiter
import Redis from 'ioredis';

class RedisRateLimiter {
    constructor(private redis: Redis) {}

    async consume(key: string, limit: number, window: number): Promise<boolean> {
        const now = Date.now();
        const windowKey = `ratelimit:${key}:${Math.floor(now / window)}`;

        const multi = this.redis.multi();

        // Increment counter
        multi.incr(windowKey);

        // Set expiry
        multi.pexpire(windowKey, window);

        // Execute atomically
        const results = await multi.exec();

        if (!results) return false;

        const count = results[0][1] as number;

        return count <= limit;
    }
}

// Usage
const limiter = new RedisRateLimiter(redis);

app.use('/api', async (req, res, next) => {
    const userId = req.user?.id || req.ip;
    const allowed = await limiter.consume(`user:${userId}`, 100, 60000);

    if (!allowed) {
        res.setHeader('Retry-After', 60);
        return res.status(429).json({
            error: 'Rate limit exceeded'
        });
    }

    next();
});
```

